  "music": "w1-doodle-docks",
  "authorNotes": "Solo. Wide, generous piers (900px each) and two short 240px swing gaps well inside the solo budget — nothing here should feel like a real test after 04. All three objectives are gettable on one relaxed pass: grab camera-5 and both relics on the way (relic-w1-05-a is right on the starting pier, relic-w1-05-b right on the middle pier — neither requires detouring), and snap the photo (allSeatsInFrame + allAirborne) mid-arc on either swing. No checkpoint: the whole level is short enough to stay under the no-checkpoint cap, and a death just means a quick, easy replay."
